<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks in September.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks in September.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges from September 2 to 27, exchange data showed.</p>
<p> Total foreign buying	   1,559.27 billion yen</p>
<p> Total foreign selling	  1,379.66 billion yen</p>
<p> Net buying			   179.61 billion yen</p>
<p>Note - All figures are rounded.</p>
</text>
